# Individuals rather than a team: the speclynx organisation has no teams, and
# creating one for two people would be indirection without a reader.
#
# Both members are listed because one owner deadlocks. GitHub does not let a
# pull request author satisfy the code-owner review requirement themselves, so a
# single owner cannot merge their own change to the files below and nobody else
# can approve it either.
#
# .github/ as a whole rather than .github/workflows/ alone: owning the workflows
# but not this file would let a contributor change who owns the workflows and
# then change the workflows.
/.github/ @char0n @frantuma
